{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stellar Rhythm is a high-energy, experimental side-scrolling space shooter where sound and vision collide. Every element of the game is fused to the music: your ship\u2019s weapons fire with the rhythm, enemies attack in perfect sync, and vibrant, shifting settings warp and pulse to the beat. Even your <i>supermoves</i> don\u2019t just unleash destruction - they remix the soundtrack in real time, turning the battlefield into a living, breathing instrument.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.poster.avif?t=1773255968\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.webm?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/043c87be01684cb4a0c7484cd7d9e9fc.mp4?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Designed for maximum immersion, Stellar Rhythm runs fluidly at 120fps, wrapping players in a kaleidoscope of color, rhythm, and explosive action. With multiple game modes, deep progression, and unlockable upgrades, every run is a fresh, pulse-pounding journey through light and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.poster.avif?t=1773255968\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.webm?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.mp4?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Created entirely by a solo developer - award-winning DJ and music producer Azido 88 - Stellar Rhythm brings decades of underground music culture and energy into a unique, experimental gameplay experience. Part shmup, part interactive music visualizer: Stellar Rhythm is a trippy audiovisual ride that pushes  into new territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.poster.avif?t=1773255968\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.webm?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.mp4?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The soundtrack fuels the experience with a globe-spanning mix of underground sound: from raw drum &amp; bass and breakbeat to hard-hitting electro, hypnotic house, thunderous dubstep, bass-heavy hip-hop, and laid-back lofi beats. Every track fuels a seamless fusion of music and gameplay.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3280990?t=1773255968","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/1bf52d4492ff001dc7c92f807385a55ee936c4a1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773255968","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap