grades, every run is a fresh, pulse-pounding journey through light and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.poster.avif?t=1773255968\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.webm?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/c0e37f875f69e52cb54a528eb56845f1.mp4?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Created entirely by a solo developer - award-winning DJ and music producer Azido 88 - Stellar Rhythm brings decades of underground music culture and energy into a unique, experimental gameplay experience. Part shmup, part interactive music visualizer: Stellar Rhythm is a trippy audiovisual ride that pushes  into new territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.poster.avif?t=1773255968\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.webm?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/548aeb764fd4235bf3f8a2874ca7861f.mp4?t=1773255968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The soundtrack fuels the experience with a globe-spanning mix of underground sound: from raw drum &amp; bass and breakbeat to hard-hitting electro, hypnotic house, thunderous dubstep, bass-heavy hip-hop, and laid-back lofi beats. Every track fuels a seamless fusion of music and gameplay.</p>","developers":["Azido Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/13b94b3a9bf36f3e55946ee444a2270ad6e3d34b/header.jpg?t=1773255968","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3280990/1174668761/cb8377657a06db9de57c4d36df63a75c3da789d4/1759219906/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759220367","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3280990/1174668761/cb8377657a06db9de57c4d36df63a75c3da789d4/1759219906/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759220367","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3280990/1174668761/cb8377657a06db9de57c4d36df63a75c3da789d4/1759219906/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759220367","id":257209124,"name":"Stellar Rhythm Demo Out Now","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257209124/ce6dc970be457d24539a8803f1bebf9b6759e088/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759220367"}],"name":"Stellar Rhythm","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 3.0 GHz 64 bits Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11-compatible graphics card with at least 512MB of video memory<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 3.5GHz 64 bits Processor<br></li><li><stro